{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e4104cb20ece344cabc31ab45dede409294723a568563148c4d73a8223c7e2fd","ja":"念には念を！","zh":"慎重起见！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c0aca538ccc0bafb27e3dd29e69ba12ba2ab0277c3b6dd6bc0a83db8b9a2645a","ja":"2日後……","zh":"2天后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"629f3cf3c03e83c5495011dbd6b8803d9b97c839acd0164d8c4069f921449a4b","ja":"たまき、やっぱりカゼのひきはじめだったんだって。\n病院に行ってよかったぞ。","zh":"环果然还是刚开始感冒呢。\n去了医院真是太好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3d4daa5c6dcbf824e61d181fa767c79bf989726f95a35a945b6ab0ff7cc1eb87","ja":"本当？　わたしの気にしすぎじゃなくてよかった！","zh":"真的吗？不是我瞎操心真是太好了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"be48ec77548d54b53ed9b12eaa95810a810575e838287a5d29d9aef61a74d897","ja":"それでね、「ひどくなる前に、病院に来てえらいね」\nって、先生にほめられたんだ。くふふ♪","zh":"然后呢，医生夸我说\n“在变严重之前就来看病，真了不起呢”。嘻呼呼♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c21fb71eee214c11cac86719cb474a73d7574868ec3eb5c496eee96cfcd6ca4d","ja":"お薬も飲んで、いっぱいねたから、\nもう大丈夫だぞ！","zh":"吃了药，也睡了很久，\n已经没事啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"294244ef8136617be9aedb00ce2ef9df62cced233659cca62a9797a9095bc317","ja":"え？　でも、昨日1日休んだだけでしょ？\nそんなにすぐに、なおるのかな？","zh":"咦？可是，昨天只休息了1天吧？\n会好得那么快吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"352e9006e5adc8d8b893898d62ea69aeeb13270a3f7eb2a2fc92c5df5aa7bcac","ja":"ゆだんしたら、長引いちゃうかもしれないよ？","zh":"大意的话，说不定会拖延很久哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"675c1bf73efa5aede8ce767cc71355082158a1aedc312a7ae63bd49fe6b0f82d","ja":"そうね。風邪はひき始めが肝心っていうし。","zh":"是啊。毕竟常言道，感冒初期的应对最为关键。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f806082c5bb5593d15a35401efe9e8e98b39866d2f451a9f0a8eb9821ed442de","ja":"なら、環が少しでも早く完治するように、\nあたしたちで、面倒見てやろうぜ！","zh":"那就为了让环能哪怕早一点痊愈，\n由我们来照顾她吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"a6f04f9176fd8d8f713fef90fbab6444c7cef8e40199bba4323e4d0adb5005be","ja":"それじゃあ……。","zh":"那么……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"41effd4448f6ce241d8b911d65e1a6091072b011af9e616fbfdaf68afa30a45b","ja":"はい、お水！　たいちょうが悪いときは、\nいっぱい水分を取らないといけないんだって！","zh":"给你水！身体不舒服的时候，\n听说必须要多补充水分才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"82f7bd7c388bf1159515074f48654782be88083bdb50d9c8ea9842a46c99b1ee","ja":"わかったぞ！　ありがとう、育！","zh":"我知道了！谢谢你，育！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"fccdfb36403ba15e87f9e08c0b742913b3e9ce2ce346277cd04a3c18d1aa391f","ja":"たしか、ハチミツ飴とりんごが\n給湯室にあったはず……持ってくるわね！","zh":"我记得茶水间里应该有\n蜂蜜糖和苹果……我去拿过来哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"9d73c362c92d00b219a9ce34395ce2fc3dd5912625ff9945f5f5030f9ce3b5c9","ja":"なんか、ネギとか首に巻くといいんだっけ？\nカオリ、あたしも一緒に行くよ！","zh":"好像把大葱之类的围在脖子上会比较好来着？\n歌织，我也一起去吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e","ja":"そして……","zh":"然后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"e15aaf9cf0874ef057f864324252d9a898e81d0d22b5d53ab95a207afcd3a90a","ja":"どうだ、環？　カオリのすりおろしりんごに、\nあたし特製の、ネギ巻きガーゼタオル！","zh":"怎么样，环？歌织磨的苹果泥，\n加上我特制的葱卷纱布毛巾！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"5037de1016b200acd440a055904f5b778b592a97c9104531bcc9933c2d0f8fad","ja":"ネギのツーンってにおいが強すぎて、\nリンゴの味がわかんないぞ～！？","zh":"葱那股冲鼻的气味太强了，\n根本尝不出苹果的味道啦～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"c643f53260602ab9371f3b62768467eda07788292c3e9fcc462e61b0b2ad1caa","ja":"あとは、体もちゃんと温めないといけないわね。\nこのブランケットで、しっかり体を包んでね。","zh":"还有，身体也得好好暖和一下才行呢。\n用这条毯子，把身体严实地裹好哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[55].text","source_sha256":"e051ce33afffdba19a6a55526e1349e7f2ba74d25ab70876f5d16af2d6abc7de","ja":"美咲さんに相談したら、しょうが湯を作って\nくれたの！　はい、どうぞ！","zh":"我和美咲小姐商量了一下，她就帮我煮了\n姜汤呢！给，请用吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[57].text","source_sha256":"cdda7b892d8f18338d8763d5388bffe35a7f665029c86f42bd846a888dd77bca","ja":"えっ？\nたまき、もうのどかわいてないよ？","zh":"诶？\n环现在已经不口渴了哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"fb5d97a9f11dfe411e900cf447b3d6dc8107c5d4d2362fcadd4cf5c31388ca17","ja":"まあまあ。のどのケアは、\nシンガーとしても大切だぜ。","zh":"好啦好啦。保养喉咙，\n对歌手来说也是很重要的哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"f6c8ea617db2b647b77d0d7ad91536fbc0ed945f8fe8ead06bc3aa7f8595cafd","ja":"あとは、上着も増やすか。\nこれとこれと……。","zh":"然后，外套也多加几件吧。\n这个还有这个……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[61].text","source_sha256":"9484f110c1360c52db075b7177fbe29782e9fe8476c82531f8c6840cb76bd49e","ja":"わぁっ！？　こんなに着たら暑すぎるし、\n苦しいぞ～！！","zh":"哇啊！？穿这么多不仅热过头了，\n还很难受啊～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1530.unity3d","item_key":"commands[62].text","source_sha256":"072d1226888de115998f7781a2a44512a9035536dc252553cd676c572b558ce1","ja":"ちょ、ちょっと待って～～！！","zh":"等、等等一下～～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
